ent-FoodPizzaBase = { ent-SolutionNormal }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionNormal.desc }
ent-FoodPizzaSliceBase = { ent-SolutionVeryTiny }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionVeryTiny.desc }
ent-FoodPizzaMargherita = 瑪格麗特披薩 | margherita pizza
    .desc = 義大利的風味。 | The flavor of Italy.
ent-FoodPizzaMargheritaSlice = 一片瑪格麗特披薩 | slice of margherita pizza
    .desc = 一抹義大利風情。 | A slice of Italy.
ent-FoodPizzaMeat = 肉類披薩 | meat pizza
    .desc = 油膩的披薩，配上美味的肉。 | Greasy pizza with delicious meat.
ent-FoodPizzaMeatSlice = 肉片披薩 | slice of meat pizza
    .desc = 一片營養豐富的肉類披薩。 | A nutritious slice of meatpizza.
ent-FoodPizzaMushroom = 蘑菇披薩 | mushroom pizza
    .desc = 一款非常特別的披薩。 | Very special pizza.
ent-FoodPizzaMushroomSlice = 一片蘑菇披薩 | slice of mushroom pizza
    .desc = 說不定這會是你這輩子吃到的最後一片披薩。 | Maybe it is the last slice of pizza in your life.
ent-FoodPizzaVegetable = 蔬菜披薩 | vegetable pizza
    .desc = 本頻道的素食者會感謝你做了這道菜。 | The station's vegetarians will thank you for making this.
ent-FoodPizzaVegetableSlice = 一片蔬菜披薩 | slice of vegetable pizza
    .desc = 即使是最挑剔的太空站工作人員，吃上一片就足夠滿足了。 | A slice of this is enough to satisfy even the pickiest station personnel.
ent-FoodPizzaDonkpocket = 唐克口袋披薩 | donk-pocket pizza
    .desc = 誰會覺得這是個好主意呢？ | Who thought this would be a good idea?
ent-FoodPizzaDonkpocketSlice = 一片「唐克口袋披薩」 | slice of donk-pocket pizza
    .desc = 聞起來像「donk-pocket」。 | Smells like donk-pocket.
ent-FoodPizzaDank = 超棒的披薩 | dank pizza
    .desc = 嬉皮士最愛吃的披薩。 | The hippie's pizza of choice.
ent-FoodPizzaDankSlice = 一片超棒的披薩 | slice of dank pizza
    .desc = 太棒了，老兄…… | So good, man...
ent-FoodPizzaSassysage = sassysage 披薩 | sassysage pizza
    .desc = 那股倔強勁兒真的能嗅得出來。 | You can really smell the sassiness.
ent-FoodPizzaSassysageSlice = 一片「Sassysage」披薩 | slice of sassysage pizza
    .desc = 既美味又俏皮。 | Deliciously sassy.
ent-FoodPizzaPineapple = 夏威夷披薩 | Hawaiian pizza
    .desc = 讓人忍不住潸然淚下。是喜極而泣還是悲從中來，則取決於當事人對鳳梨的喜愛程度。 | Makes people burst into tears. Tears of joy or sadness depends on the person's fondness for pineapple.
ent-FoodPizzaPineappleSlice = 一片夏威夷披薩 | slice of Hawaiian pizza
    .desc = 一抹喜悅／罪惡。 | A slice of joy/sin.
ent-FoodPizzaArnold = 阿諾德的披薩 | Arnold's pizza
    .desc = 您好，您撥打的是阿諾德披薩店。我現在不在，我正出門去「殺」佩佩羅尼呢。 | Hello, you've reached Arnold's pizza shop. I'm not here now, I'm out killing pepperoni.
ent-FoodPizzaArnoldSlice = 阿諾德披薩的一片 | slice of Arnold's pizza
    .desc = 我過去的話，說不定會送你一份披薩，說不定會把你的手臂掰斷。 | I come over, maybe I give you a pizza, maybe I break off your arm.
ent-FoodPizzaMoldySlice = 一片發霉的披薩 | slice of moldy pizza
    .desc = 這原本是一片完好無缺的披薩，但如今卻躺在這兒，既已變質，又布滿孢子。 | Once a perfectly good slice of pizza pie, but now it lies here, rancid and bursting with spores.
ent-FoodPizzaUranium = 辛辣搖滾披薩 | spicy rock pizza
    .desc = 鋪滿辣椒和鈾的辣味披薩。 | Spicy pizza covered in peppers and uranium.
ent-FoodPizzaUraniumSlice = 一片辣味搖滾披薩 | slice of spicy rock pizza
    .desc = 一片熱氣騰騰、辣味十足的搖滾披薩。 | A glowing slice of spicy rock pizza.
ent-FoodPizzaCotton = 棉花披薩 | cotton pizza
    .desc = 扁平的棉質麵團，表面鋪有棉花。太棒了。 | Flat fabric cotton dough with cotton topping. Incredible.
ent-FoodPizzaCottonSlice = 一片棉花披薩 | slice of cotton pizza
    .desc = 一片棉花披薩。內含棉花。 | A slice of cotton pizza. Cotton included.
ent-FoodPizzaWorldpeas = 世界和平 | world peazza
    .desc = 現代外交，以圓盤之姿呈現。 | Modern diplomacy in the shape of a disc.
ent-FoodPizzaWorldpeasSlice = 世界的一角——佩阿扎 | slice of world peazza
    .desc = 為了維持和諧，將世界劃分為不同區域，這代價微不足道。 | Dividing the world up is a small price to pay for harmony.
